# Frame budget guard at 50 fps: the demo is the worst case - the spread gun
# (three shots at a time), every wave, the Warden and its death, the music.
# Measured: ~60-80% on average, peaks up to 100% (the Warden going down).
wait-serial "AGK t0"
wait-serial "phase=1" 1200
wait 4800
expect-no-dropped-frames
expect-max-load 100
